		'SYSTEM.md is now the prompt measured in the lab (user decision 8 Oct): Rules, Actions with examples, $tools_summary. The summary/question endings are commented out for now; User notes sit in ::: if user_notes="true" (q5), off under HAL_NO_USER_NOTES for benchmarks.',
